# Ownership routing. Advisory only.
#
# Branch protection does NOT require code-owner approval: with a single
# maintainer, GitHub cannot count the author's own review, so requiring it
# would deadlock every pull request. This file therefore documents ownership
# and requests review automatically once a second maintainer exists.
#
# Promote to enforcing (Require review from Code Owners) only after a second
# person with write access joins. See docs/release-governance.md.

*                       @Locker-r

# Highest blast radius: schema, RLS policies, SECURITY DEFINER functions.
/supabase/              @Locker-r

# Governance and CI configuration protects every other rule in this repository.
/.github/               @Locker-r

